 "mechanisms": {
  "P0-CONTROL-create_spec": "Speak only when the repository has no spec at all. The shipped W6 rule: absence of a spec is the moment a new thing is about to be specified.",
  "P1-ANY-OWNER": "Speak whenever the corpus holds adjudicated authority about the proposal. The VALUE of the signal is a property of the proposal; the current CONDITION is a property of the directory, and the two are independent.",
  "P2-CONSTRUCTION-INTENT": "Speak when authority exists AND the prompt is about building, integrating or extending. A correct owner delivered during a repair arrives after the location was already chosen.",
  "P3-TIER3-ONLY": "Speak when authority exists AND the work is Strategic/Platform. Duplication is most expensive where it becomes a standard.",
  "P4-STRONG-EVIDENCE": "Speak when the corpus holds SUBSTANTIAL adjudicated authority about the owner, measured in units, not merely one match.",
  "P5-CONSTRUCTION-AND-STRONG": "Both bounds at once: the decision must be open, and the corpus must have something substantial to say about it."
 },
